{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_cluster_singleton", "label": "Cluster-Singleton", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Actor, der genau einmal im Cluster existiert; Singletons tauschen etwas Unverf\u00fcgbarkeit beim Failover gegen Einzigartigkeit."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_clustersingletonproxy", "label": "ClusterSingletonProxy", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_singletonkey", "label": "SingletonKey", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Die Rolle geh\u00f6rt auf den Key: sie ist nicht Teil der Identit\u00e4t, f\u00e4hrt aber mit, damit jede Node dieselbe liest \u2014 eine allein \u00fcber withRole gesetzte Rolle ist f\u00fcr eine Node, die nur ref aufruft, unsichtbar."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_start_vs_ref", "label": "start() gegen\u00fcber ref()", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ref.stop() ist ein warnender No-Op, weil ein PoisonPill hier t\u00f6ten w\u00fcrde, was der aktuelle Leader hostet."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_buffersize", "label": "bufferSize des Proxys", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Puffer wird beim ersten Cluster-Event geleert, das einen Host hervorgebracht haben kann \u2014 nicht nur bei einem Leader-Wechsel; vor v0.17.0 blieb er f\u00fcr ein rollenbeschr\u00e4nktes Singleton unbegrenzt ungeleert."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_failover_sequence", "label": "Failover-Ablauf", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_warm_handover", "label": "Warme \u00dcbergabe", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "F\u00fcr Zustand, der teuer wiederherzustellen, aber billig zu kopieren ist. restoreFromHandOver l\u00e4uft nach dem Konstruktor und vor preStart \u2014 die einzige Position, von der aus die Wiederherstellung noch \u00fcbersprungen werden kann. Sie darf ausbleiben und f\u00e4llt dann auf den Kaltstart zur\u00fcck."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_warmhandoveractor", "label": "WarmHandOverActor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "serializeForHandOver wird nach postStop gerufen, der Snapshot ist also endg\u00fcltig; eine an einem Crash gestorbene Instanz wird nie gefragt."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_no_singletonactor_interface", "label": "Es gibt bewusst kein SingletonActor-Interface", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "TypeScripts implements pr\u00fcft nur die Instanzseite, ein Marker w\u00e4re strukturell leer; ein statisches Feld komponiert mit jeder Basisklasse, was z\u00e4hlt, weil ein Singleton h\u00e4ufig auch ein PersistentActor ist."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_split_brain_defenses", "label": "Split-Brain-Verteidigungen", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_cluster_singleton", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_clustersingletonproxy", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_cluster_singleton", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_singletonkey", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_cluster_singleton", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_start_vs_ref", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/singleton/overview.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_clustersingletonproxy", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_singleton_overview_buffersize", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_